          "date": "2026-06-08 12:38:21.000000000",
          "tz": 120
        },
        "subject": "LU-19079 krb: introduce lustre_role principal",
        "message": "LU-19079 krb: introduce lustre_role principal\n\nIntroduce support for new client Kerberos principal in the form:\nlustre_role/NODEMAP_NAME@REALM\n\nThis principal does not have a hostname, so it is valid for use by any\nclient node. But it is only accepted by Lustre servers if the nodemap\nthis principal refers to has the gss identification property set.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nTest-Parameters: testgroup=review-dne-selinux-ssk-part-1\nTest-Parameters: testgroup=review-dne-selinux-ssk-part-2\nTest-Parameters: kerberos=true testlist=sanity-krb5\nSigned-off-by: Sebastien Buisson <sbuisson@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: Ia820f83e741da718ea4f16bc521dbfe869486d49\nReviewed-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Li Xi <lixi@ddn.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
